description= <PUSHRGB:0.85,0.75,0.45> Step on the scale. Face the truth. <POPRGB> <LINE> <LINE>
description= The clinic's beam scale still works. Stand on it and a brass and cream readout settles on your exact weight, to one decimal, the number the apocalypse actually did to you. <LINE> <LINE>
description= - Left click the readout: switch kg / lb (remembered). Each scale has its own look: the clinic scale keeps its beam head, the Digital Scale its native panel. <LINE>
description= - The character screen's Info tab only ever shows the weight category in words, with its trend arrow, so the scale is the only way to see the number. <LINE>
description= - Stopping on the scale turns your survivor once to face its column. <LINE>
description= - Two short sounds: stepping on, stepping off. <LINE>
description= - Right click the scale itself: "Step on Scale" walks you there. <LINE>
description= - Everyone on the scale is weighed, survivors, animals and zombies, added up. Stand next to it to read a patient. <LINE>
description= - New, Build 42 only: the Digital Scale, a small home scale you place on the floor or on a counter, in four facings, and pick up again. It shows a plain native panel, reads 0 to 130 kg, and weighs people, animals and zombies on the floor and items on it or on a counter. <LINE>
description= - You only read a scale you are facing, and stepping onto a Digital Scale turns you to look at its screen. <LINE>
description= - Digital Scales turn up in bathroom counters and on the floor of big enough home and motel bathrooms in areas of the map nobody has explored yet, never in public restrooms. <LINE>
description= - Sandbox options: weigh what you carry, weigh the whole square, reading distance, Digital Scale in bathroom counters (0 to 20, default 3), Digital Scale on bathroom floors (percent, default 20). <LINE>
description= - Splitscreen: every local player gets their own readout. <LINE>
description= - 28 languages. Very light, no dependencies. <LINE> <LINE>
description= Replaces the old "Weight Scale" (Workshop item 2833096579). Disable that one before enabling this one.
